  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Protection Assistance to victims of Information Redacted in Seneg</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IOM will focus on the reinforcement of child protection during the COVID-19 pandemic. This will be accomplished by supporting four under-resourced national reception centers to provide education and play equipment, clothes, hygiene kits, and monthly food</narrative>
